        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "He must study English."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "He must be studying English."
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He must have studied English."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He might have studied English."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "He would have studied English."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "He should have studied English."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "We were living in Seoul then."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I will have soup first and then the chicken."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "If it's not on the table, then it will be in the drawer."
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Can I leave a message, then?"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "He is rich."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "So he can buy it."
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Don't be so pessimistic."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "He is so poor that he can not buy it."
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I did not have an apple."
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Instead, I had a peach."
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Instead of going to school, he went fishing."
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "He will retain his position until he decides otherwise."
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "The law made hundreds of otherwise honest men lawbreakers."
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "He worked hard; otherwise, he would have failed."
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "I have some money."
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "I have some 50 dollars."
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Will you give me some apples?"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Some people like fish and some don't."
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "I didn't see any person."
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "I saw some people."
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "I want anything sweet."
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "I want something sweet."
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Even I know it."
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "He hasn't come yet."
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Yet, I'm sure he will be here any minute."
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "The time is yet to come."
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "It is the largest diamond yet found."
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "The war still goes on."
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Stand still."
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "He felt tired, still he continued his work."
        }
      ]
